education.description:
Investigated the chemical properties of carbon nanotubes in water including:
 - Electrochemical properties of materials encapsualted inside SWNTs for power storage and changes in solvent properties;
 - Chemical oxidation of materials encapsualted inside SWNTs;
 - Encapsualtion of SWNTs with biological polymers for studies of the solvation properties in water.
Published  2 articles in Journal of Materials Chemistry, 3 articles Journal of Physical Chemistry C,  and 1 article in Advanced Materials.

